# Test Suite for the Royal Checkout Experience

*Grace and beauty are not ornaments - they are the experience.*

Noble court, I present a test suite worthy of Camelot's standards. Each test ensures our guests feel welcomed and guided, as befits those who enter our halls.

```typescript
import { describe, it, expect, vi, beforeEach } from 'vitest';
import { render, screen, waitFor } from '@testing-library/react';
import userEvent from '@testing-library/user-event';
import { axe, toHaveNoViolations } from 'jest-axe';
import { Checkout } from './Checkout';

expect.extend(toHaveNoViolations);

// Mock contexts
const mockCartContext = {
  items: [{ id: '1', name: 'Excalibur Polish', price: 29.99 }],
  total: 29.99,
  clearCart: vi.fn(),
};

const mockPaymentContext = {
  processPayment: vi.fn(),
};

vi.mock('./CartContext', () => ({ useCart: () => mockCartContext }));
vi.mock('./PaymentContext', () => ({ usePayment: () => mockPaymentContext }));

describe('Checkout - The Royal Commerce Journey', () => {
  const user = userEvent.setup();

  beforeEach(() => {
    vi.clearAllMocks();
    mockCartContext.items = [{ id: '1', name: 'Excalibur Polish', price: 29.99 }];
  });

  describe('Happy Path - A Knight Completing Their Quest', () => {
    it('completes full checkout flow from shipping to confirmation', async () => {
      mockPaymentContext.processPayment.mockResolvedValue({ orderId: 'ORD-12345' });
      const onComplete = vi.fn();
      render(<Checkout onComplete={onComplete} />);

      // Shipping step
      await user.type(screen.getByLabelText(/street address/i), '123 Round Table Lane');
      await user.type(screen.getByLabelText(/city/i), 'Camelot');
      await user.selectOptions(screen.getByLabelText(/state/i), 'CA');
      await user.type(screen.getByLabelText(/zip code/i), '90210');
      await user.click(screen.getByRole('button', { name: /continue to payment/i }));

      // Payment step
      await user.type(screen.getByLabelText(/card number/i), '4111111111111111');
      await user.type(screen.getByLabelText(/expiry/i), '12/25');
      await user.type(screen.getByLabelText(/cvv/i), '123');
      await user.type(screen.getByLabelText(/name on card/i), 'Sir Lancelot');
      await user.click(screen.getByRole('button', { name: /review order/i }));

      // Review step
      expect(screen.getByText(/excalibur polish/i)).toBeInTheDocument();
      await user.click(screen.getByRole('button', { name: /place order/i }));

      // Confirmation
      await waitFor(() => {
        expect(screen.getByText(/order confirmed/i)).toBeInTheDocument();
        expect(screen.getByText('ORD-12345')).toBeInTheDocument();
      });
      expect(onComplete).toHaveBeenCalledWith('ORD-12345');
    });
  });

  describe('Form Validation - Guarding the Gate', () => {
    it('displays error when street address is empty', async () => {
      render(<Checkout />);
      await user.click(screen.getByRole('button', { name: /continue to payment/i }));
      expect(screen.getByText(/street address is required/i)).toBeInTheDocument();
      expect(screen.getByLabelText(/street address/i)).toHaveAttribute('aria-invalid', 'true');
    });

    it('validates ZIP code format', async () => {
      render(<Checkout />);
      await user.type(screen.getByLabelText(/zip code/i), 'invalid');
      await user.click(screen.getByRole('button', { name: /continue to payment/i }));
      expect(screen.getByText(/valid zip code required/i)).toBeInTheDocument();
    });
  });

  describe('Error States - When Dragons Attack', () => {
    it('displays payment error and allows retry', async () => {
      mockPaymentContext.processPayment.mockRejectedValueOnce(new Error('Card declined'));
      // ... navigate to review step ...
      await user.click(screen.getByRole('button', { name: /place order/i }));
      await waitFor(() => expect(screen.getByRole('alert')).toHaveTextContent(/card declined/i));
    });
  });

  describe('Edge Cases - Empty Cart', () => {
    it('shows empty cart message when no items', () => {
      mockCartContext.items = [];
      render(<Checkout />);
      expect(screen.getByText(/your cart is empty/i)).toBeInTheDocument();
    });
  });

  describe('Accessibility - All Knights Welcome at the Round Table', () => {
    it('has no accessibility violations', async () => {
      const { container } = render(<Checkout />);
      expect(await axe(container)).toHaveNoViolations();
    });
  });
});
```

*The user should feel as welcome as a knight at the Round Table.*
